281Z","description":"lite and fast version of just-dna-seq personalized genomic platform","topics":["biohacking","genomics","longevity","research"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":63448548,"repository":"github.com/vcs-python/libvcs","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":58,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T00:40:48.874922Z","description":"⚙️ Lite, typed, pythonic utilities for git, svn, mercurial, etc.","topics":["vcs","python","git","hg","python-3","svn","api","library","pythonic","mercurial","subversion","parsing","url-parser"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64174938,"repository":"github.com/seed-hypermedia/seed","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":57,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T19:25:26.776432Z","description":"Desktop+Web app for self-publishing, powered by the open Hypermedia protocol"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64170650,"repository":"github.com/alkoleft/mcp-bsl-platform-context","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":197,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T02:57:07.09032Z","description":"MCP сервер для AI-ассистентов (справка по синтаксису и объектной модели 1С:Предприятие)","topics":["bsl","mcp","mcp-server"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64277370,"repository":"github.com/snyk/studio-mcp","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":55,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:35:37.800448Z"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":57717768,"repository":"github.com/quantified-uncertainty/squiggle","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":221,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T00:19:43.984549Z","description":"This monorepo covers multiple QURI projects, including Squiggle language, Squiggle Hub and Metaforecast","topics":["probability","forecasting"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64318240,"repository":"github.com/ofershap/real-browser-mcp","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":53,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T19:30:20.252886Z","description":"MCP server + Chrome extension that gives AI agents control of your real browser with existing sessions and logins","topics":["ai","browser-automation","chrome-extension","claude","cursor","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","typescript"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64341271,"repository":"github.com/sandraschi/blender-mcp","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":53,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T02:40:47.214994Z","description":"Headless Blender automation via FastMCP — 41 portmanteau tools (150+ ops). Batch mesh/VSE/Grease Pencil, VRM, Gaussian splats; optional live bridge. For Cursor / Claude Desktop. React dashboard + Tauri app.","topics":["blender","mcp-server","webapp","3d-modeling","animation","fastmcp","fleet","gaussian-splatting","grease-pencil","mcp","tauri","vse","vrm-avatar","headless","model-context-protocol"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64320368,"repository":"github.com/hongmaple0820/scale-engine","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":53,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T21:01:57.342065Z","description":"SCALE Engine 是一个 AI 工程化脚手架引擎，为 AI Agent（Claude Code、Codex CLI、OpenCode、Cursor、Gemini CLI 等）提供物理约束层，确保 AI 在编码过程中遵循工程规范，而不是依赖提示词的\"自律\"。"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64341520,"repository":"github.com/KongFangXun/sofagent","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":52,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T00:18:09.898934Z","description":"sofagent is an open-source FDE Harness for AI coding agents — on entry, write your business judgment into files (workflows, ontology, AI nodes); after departure, audit every change against them. 25 codified audit rules, tamper-evident chain, snapshots, and an MCP toolset (104 tools, 11 plugins). Everything can be FDEing.","topics":["typescript","agent-governance","agent-audit","ai-safety","enterprise-ai","git-hooks","compliance","ai-agents","mcp","llm-governance","dsh","ontology","openclaw","pre-commit","secret-scanning","harness","llm","ai-security","code-review","dsh-plugin"]}]

